<figure class="fig"><div class="fig-body"><div class="widget" data-widget="blockreduce" data-args="{}"></div></div><figcaption>Reducing the two-loop servo step by step: the inner velocity loop collapses into one block, then the series blocks merge, then the outer loop closes. The transfer function at each step is shown below.</figcaption></figure>
